NOTE OpenIE Research TV — ai-reads-human (30s) AI-synthesized studio narration

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.394
Software agents routinely serialize numbers into JSON or YAML strings,

2
00:00:04.394 --> 00:00:06.792
tokenize them, and parse them right back.

3
00:00:07.272 --> 00:00:10.407
AI Reads Human defines this extra work with physical

4
00:00:10.407 --> 00:00:14.144
units across 170 isolated measurement windows on Apple M5 Max.

5
00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:19.540
A fixed binary struct costs 280 nanojoules per record;

6
00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:26.276
JSON costs 2.2 microjoules, cl100k tokenization 27.7, and Python YAML 576.

7
00:00:26.756 --> 00:00:32.712
Render human text for human eyes, and keep machine-to-machine channels binary—with Falsifier 6 guarding telemetry.
